  "model": "problems.problem",
  "pk": 14,
  "fields": {
    "order_num": 2,
    "title": "Voting Eligibility Check",
    "slug": "voting-eligibility-check",
    "description": "Write a Python program that asks the user to enter their age. Then check if the user is eligible to vote or not. A person is eligible to vote only if their age is 18 or above. If the age is 18 or more, print \"Eligible to vote\". If the age is less than 18, print \"Not eligible to vote\". The program must take age as input from the user.",
